ta-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"647f2f13-fe8a-4277-88ab-8b506348d322"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance\n识别场景：视频监控 (video_surveillance)；场景模式：single；候选场景：video_surveillance\n任务切分：\n- 请按每 2 秒从视频中抽取一帧，并为每帧生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录。\n任务规划：\n1. 读取输入视频文件并校验其编码格式与总时长，初始化视频解析引擎，配置2秒固定时间步长的抽样策略，完成视频资源加载与监控场景下抽样参数的预加载。\n2. 基于已配置的步长触发视频流逐帧解码采样，同步抓取当前播放精确时间戳、追溯原始视频源标识，并调用图像属性接口获取每帧分辨率（宽×高），输出含原始帧快照及基础元数据的中间态数据集。\n3. 将时间戳、来源标识与图像尺寸字段映射至预设数据结构模板，统一数据类型与键名规范，批量组装为符合指定输出形式的结构化记录序列。\n4. 校验生成记录是否严格遵循2秒等间隔逻辑，核查时间戳连续性、来源字段非空性及图像尺寸格式规范性，对首尾及抽样样本执行完整性稽核，输出待交付的结构化记录清单。\n场景任务：\n- video_surveillance: 我将按每2秒从视频监控中抽取一帧，并为每帧生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录。；参数：{'输出形式': '每 2 秒抽取一帧并生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录'}\n已提取参数：{'输出形式': '每 2 秒抽取一帧并生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录'}\n任务提示：\n- 提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧\n- 提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等\n- 提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"6c7ac9ed-17f4-44c0-8dab-b39bedbbd1d0"},{"content":"我需要确认视频文件的位置才能执行抽取任务。请问：\n\n1. **视频文件路径**：您要分析的视频文件在哪里？是已上传到系统的文件，还是需要我搜索特定位置的视频？\n\n如果您有具体的视频文件路径，请直接提供，我将立即开始按每2秒抽取一帧并生成结构化记录。","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":182,"prompt_tokens":10928,"total_tokens":11110,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":110,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":182},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10928}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-b42b2fb2-9835-90ed-b596-dd510f968146","finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f8f67-eb23-77f0-918c-6ef63fea09c1-0","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10928,"output_tokens":182,"total_tokens":11110,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":110}}}],"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/c508afff-9e0a-449a-9d46-fab6200be8b8/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/c508afff-9e0a-449a-9d46-fab6200be8b8/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/c508afff-9e0a-449a-9d46-fab6200be8b8/user-data/outputs"},"artifacts":[],"raw_messages":[{"content":"请按每 2 秒从视频中抽取一帧，并为每帧生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"fefe5e87-9f0a-426d-8322-73053e9ad626"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): video_surveillance. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: 请按每 2 秒从视频中抽取一帧，并为每帧生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"647f2f13-fe8a-4277-88ab-8b506348d322"}],"viewed_images":{},"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请按每 2 秒从视频中抽取一帧，并为每帧生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录。","normalized_query":"请按每 2 秒从视频中抽取一帧，并为每帧生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将按每2秒从视频监控中抽取一帧，并为每帧生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"输出形式":"每 2 秒抽取一帧并生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_35fab8","text":"请按每 2 秒从视频中抽取一帧，并为每帧生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_fd4f40","text":"读取输入视频文件并校验其编码格式与总时长，初始化视频解析引擎，配置2秒固定时间步长的抽样策略，完成视频资源加载与监控场景下抽样参数的预加载。"},{"task_span_id":"span_a0e230","text":"基于已配置的步长触发视频流逐帧解码采样，同步抓取当前播放精确时间戳、追溯原始视频源标识，并调用图像属性接口获取每帧分辨率（宽×高），输出含原始帧快照及基础元数据的中间态数据集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_1ed540","text":"将时间戳、来源标识与图像尺寸字段映射至预设数据结构模板，统一数据类型与键名规范，批量组装为符合指定输出形式的结构化记录序列。"},{"task_span_id":"span_306412","text":"校验生成记录是否严格遵循2秒等间隔逻辑，核查时间戳连续性、来源字段非空性及图像尺寸格式规范性，对首尾及抽样样本执行完整性稽核，输出待交付的结构化记录清单。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_53ed84","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将按每2秒从视频监控中抽取一帧，并为每帧生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录。","params":{"输出形式":"每 2 秒抽取一帧并生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_53ed84","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将按每2秒从视频监控中抽取一帧，并为每帧生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录。","params":{"输出形式":"每 2 秒抽取一帧并生成包含时间戳、来源和图像尺寸的结构化记录"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:fefe5e87-9f0a-426d-8322-73053e9ad626"},"routing_context":{"route_mo